WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,820 --> 00:00:03,820
Your forehead will leave a scar if you hit it on the doorknob.

2
00:00:04,790 --> 00:00:07,230
But you already have scars in that area

3
00:00:07,630 --> 00:00:09,430
So this extra thing is nothing.

4
00:00:09,630 --> 00:00:11,230
Don't tell anyone else about this.

5
00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:13,760
I've already asked for leave for you in Donghuang.

6
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:15,560
Wait until your fever is gone before going to work

7
00:00:16,830 --> 00:00:18,230
I also paid all the hospital bills.

8
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:20,980
I will deliver your three meals a day on time

9
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:24,370
did you hear

10
00:00:24,570 --> 00:00:28,640
This is not entirely my responsibility

11
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:30,440
You have problems yourself too

12
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:34,720
Who made you sleep outside in the rain all night?

13
00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:36,720
Otherwise, I'll knock you over with just one touch.

14
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,980
What else do you want to do?

15
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:41,880
I sent you to the hospital

16
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:45,010
I didn't send you in time

17
00:00:45,610 --> 00:00:47,140
You would have been burned to death

18
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:48,940
I also paid for your medicine

19
00:00:49,790 --> 00:00:51,990
I'm a college student who works part-time to earn tuition.

20
00:00:51,990 --> 00:00:53,190
not much money

21
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:55,800
You still don't forgive me
